boethius-foreknowledge.logic.r1: argue/scope: P1 (S2): read with the necessity on its consequent alone, foresees_all ∧ undeceivable → □foreseen_occurs, the argument holds; read with it on the whole conditional, □(foresees_all ∧ undeceivable → foreseen_occurs), C1 (S3) does not follow: it needs the necessity of the consequent, not only of the consequence, and which the sentence means decides the argument
